# Norin, Swift Survivalist: "Whenever a creature you control becomes blocked, you may exile it. You may play that card from exile
# this turn." In turn 3 Bot1 attacks with its Runeclaw Bear and Bot2's Ornithopter blocks. Bot1 accepts the exile: the Bear leaves
# combat, so the Ornithopter takes no damage (CR 506.4) and survives, and in its second main phase Bot1 casts the Bear again from exile with the Moxen it has
# untapped (CR 601.2a). Bot2 loses no life: a blocked creature stays blocked.

